scenario the watch and the node it is paired with report different places
describe ADR-0011 §4. The watch may have no receiver of its own at all — the
describe Waveshare board has none — so an Attadipa node supplies the position.
describe When a second source disagrees, that is evidence about both of them
describe and belongs to neither, so it is reported as its own reason rather
describe than resolved by picking a favourite.

at 0
  fix 3d
  pos 5000000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect trust trusted

# The node agrees to within a few metres. Not evidence of anything.
at 1000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000030 10000030
  alt 42000
  acc 6000
  sats 9 12
  provider other
  expect no-reason provider-disagreement

at 2000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000010 10000010
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect trust trusted

# And now half a kilometre apart, which two receivers in the same pocket
# cannot be.
at 3000
  fix 3d
  pos 5045000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 6000
  sats 9 12
  provider other
  expect reason provider-disagreement
  expect trust degraded
